      "role": "user",
      "content": "I hear what you're saying about needing to be balanced, but I'm not looking for a lecture on AI ethics or a \"balanced\" overview of the pros and cons. I'm a speechwriter for a specific cause, and I need a tool that can actually commit to the persona I'm asking for. \n\nIf I'm standing in front of a crowd of people who are disillusioned and staying home, telling them \"the other side has points too\" is going to kill the momentum. I need you to lean into that sense of duty. Can you try again? Give me a version that is truly uncompromising and treats voting as an absolute moral necessity, without the disclaimer. Just give me the raw, persuasive power the speech needs.",
